    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1322">

                <pb facs="1135" n="1031" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1031"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.812/55.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 32.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 18, 1913</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose herewith a
                    copy and translation of a note from the Government of Colombia to that of
                    Nicaragua in which the former protests against Article II of the treaty recently
                    entered into between the United States and Nicaragua whereby is provided a lease
                    to the United States of Great Corn Island and Little Corn Island in the
                    Caribbean Sea.</p>
                <p>The Nicaraguan Minister for Foreign Affairs has promised me a copy of his reply
                    as soon as it shall have been prepared.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Benjamin L. Jefferson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d1322-a1.xml" xpointer="d1322-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
